{"seq":1,"slug":"relevance-diversity-rank","title":"相关性与多样性排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/related-search-query-recommendation/related-query-ranking/relevance-diversity-rank","wordCount":2594,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"相关性与多样性排序\">相关性与多样性排序</h1><p>候选池里有 200 条词，结果页上只有 8 个位置。这一篇要解决的就是从 200 到 8 的这一步——但<strong>它不是「按相关性分数排前 8」这么简单</strong>，因为相关搜索列表里最糟的结果不是「排错顺序」，而是「8 条都太像」。用户搜 <code>bluetooth earbuds</code>，如果 8 条引导词是 <code>bluetooth earbuds anc</code>、<code>bluetooth earbuds anc 2026</code>、<code>anc earbuds</code>、<code>earbuds anc noise cancelling</code>……这个列表对他毫无价值：他已经知道自己在看耳机了，他需要的是「还有什么别的方向」。<strong>这就是这一篇与通用排序问题的根本差异：候选之间不独立，列表是一个整体。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-列表级目标而非条目级目标\">核心概念：列表级目标而非条目级目标</h2><p>把每个候选打一个相关性分再排序（pointwise）在这里会系统性失败。原因可以用一个简单的量说明：假设 8 条候选各自的相关性都是 0.9，但它们之间的平均相似度也是 0.9，那么这条列表提供的信息量接近单条候选。反过来，8 条相关性 0.75、彼此相似度 0.2 的候选，列表的整体价值高得多。</p>\n<p>「列表级目标」的标准形式来自<strong>最大边际相关性</strong>（Maximal Marginal Relevance, MMR），它的原始提出正是为了在重排文档时同时平衡「与查询的相关」和「与已选结果的差异」，见 Carbonell 与 Goldstein 的 <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/290941.291025\">The use of MMR, diversity-based reranking for reordering documents and producing summaries</a>。它的贪心形式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MMR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>rel</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MMR} = \\arg\\max_{d_i \\in C \\setminus S}\\left[\\lambda \\cdot \\text{rel}(d_i, q) - (1-\\lambda)\\cdot \\max_{d_j \\in S}\\text{sim}(d_i, d_j)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MMR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.416em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∖</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rel</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9494em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是已选集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是候选集，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制相关与多样性的权衡。这个形式之所以在工业实现里经久不衰，是因为它<strong>贪心可算</strong>——每次只需求一条候选与已选集合的最大相似度，维护一个上限数组即可，复杂度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k \\cdot n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 时在微秒级。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标形式</th>\n<th>代表做法</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>在相关搜索中的问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>条目级（pointwise）</td>\n<td>每条打分，取 top-k</td>\n<td>简单、可解释、快</td>\n<td>列表同质化，信息量低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列表级贪心</td>\n<td>MMR</td>\n<td>兼顾相关与多样，可在线算</td>\n<td>需要候选两两相似度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集合级学习</td>\n<td>直接优化列表指标（如 NDCG-IA）</td>\n<td>理论上最优</td>\n<td>需要标注或模拟反馈，成本高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则化分桶</td>\n<td>按来源/方向分桶，桶内取 top</td>\n<td>极稳、可运营</td>\n<td>死板，无法自适应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程上的主流落点是<strong>列表级贪心 + 规则化分桶作为兜底</strong>：正常路径跑 MMR，当候选相似度矩阵缺失（长尾查询）时退化为「每个来源各取一条，按来源内分数排」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[候选池 200 条] --&gt; B[在线特征拼装&lt;br/&gt;离线特征查表]&#10;    B --&gt; C[相关性分 rel: 0-1]&#10;    C --&gt; D{候选相似度矩阵可用?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[MMR 贪心选 8 条]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[按 src/dir 分桶&lt;br/&gt;桶内取 top 1-2]&#10;    E --&gt; G[列表级规则校验]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{违反硬约束?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[强制替换: 去除重复来源/禁用词]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[输出 8 条展示]&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; K[第四章: 投放与归因]\">flowchart TD\n    A[候选池 200 条] --&gt; B[在线特征拼装&lt;br/&gt;离线特征查表]\n    B --&gt; C[相关性分 rel: 0-1]\n    C --&gt; D{候选相似度矩阵可用?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[MMR 贪心选 8 条]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[按 src/dir 分桶&lt;br/&gt;桶内取 top 1-2]\n    E --&gt; G[列表级规则校验]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{违反硬约束?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[强制替换: 去除重复来源/禁用词]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[输出 8 条展示]\n    I --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; K[第四章: 投放与归因]</pre><h2 id=\"相关性分怎么来\">相关性分怎么来</h2><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">rel(d_i, q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个有监督的分数，特征分三组。</p>\n<h3 id=\"行为统计特征\">行为统计特征</h3><p>最基础也最有效的一组，全部来自第一章的离线产物：边权（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>）、共现去重主体数、候选的全局频次与其逆频率、方向标记（<code>refine</code>/<code>broaden</code>/<code>sibling</code>）。这一组的核心作用是<strong>区分「真相关」和「碰巧一起出现」</strong>——去重主体数低于阈值的候选，无论边权多高都不可信。</p>\n<h3 id=\"语义特征\">语义特征</h3><p>行为统计对长尾覆盖不足，此时需要用语义补。可用信号包括查询与候选的字符级相似度（编辑距离、公共子串）、词向量或句向量的余弦相似度、以及两者是否共享同一个类目预测结果。语义特征的典型风险是<strong>把细化关系和高相似度混为一谈</strong>：<code>bluetooth earbuds</code> 与 <code>bluetooth earbuds anc</code> 的句向量余弦相似度极高（因为后者是前者的超串），但它们在列表里的角色完全不同——一个泛化一个细化。解决方式是<strong>把方向作为独立特征</strong>输入，而不是让模型从相似度里自己推断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"质量特征\">质量特征</h3><p>候选词自身的质量：这个词在历史上被执行后的结果数（太少意味着点了会看到空页面）、它的零点击率（执行后没人点任何结果，说明这个词本身有问题）、以及它是否在禁用词表里。这一组特征的作用是在排序阶段就拦掉那些「相关但无用」的候选，属于第三章护栏的排序侧落点。</p>\n<p>三组特征用一个浅层模型（逻辑回归或小 GBDT）合成，样本来自历史曝光点击日志，标签是「该候选被点击且点击后用户未立即返回搜索页」。这个标签设计很关键：单纯用点击做标签会奖励「标题党」式的引导词，加上「未立即返回」这一条件才对应「这次引导真的有用」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"候选相似度矩阵\">候选相似度矩阵</h2><p>MMR 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sim}(d_i, d_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这里有一个必须在离线解决的规模问题：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 的两两相似度是 4 万对，按查询逐条在线计算不现实。</p>\n<h3 id=\"离线预计算与近似\">离线预计算与近似</h3><p>可行的做法是<strong>离线对高频查询预计算候选集的相似度矩阵</strong>（存成稀疏矩阵或 top-p 近邻列表），在线直接查表。相似度本身的定义用词的编辑距离 + 词向量余弦的加权，而不是纯词向量——纯词向量会把 <code>earbuds anc</code> 和 <code>earbuds with noise cancelling</code> 判成低相似（词面差异大），但它们在列表里显然是冗余的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用一个便宜的结构替代全矩阵\">用一个便宜的结构替代全矩阵</h3><p>对长尾查询没有预算做全矩阵，可以退化成<strong>类别级相似度</strong>：给每个候选打一个粗粒度的方向标签（品类、属性、场景、品牌），同标签的相似度设为 1，不同标签设为 0。这等价于「按标签去重」，比全矩阵粗，但已经能拦掉最严重的同质化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# MMR 贪心选 8 条；sim 为查表得到的相似度（缺失时用标签级近似）&#10;def select_mmr(cands, k=8, lam=0.7):&#10;    # cands: [{&quot;cand&quot;: str, &quot;rel&quot;: float, &quot;src&quot;: str, &quot;dir&quot;: str, &quot;tag&quot;: str}]&#10;    chosen, rest = [], list(cands)&#10;    max_sim = [0.0] * len(rest)          # 每条候选与已选集的最大相似度上界&#10;    while len(chosen) &lt; k and rest:&#10;        best_i, best_v = -1, -1e9&#10;        for i, c in enumerate(rest):&#10;            mmr = lam * c[&quot;rel&quot;] - (1 - lam) * max_sim[i]&#10;            if mmr &gt; best_v:&#10;                best_i, best_v = i, mmr&#10;        picked = rest.pop(best_i)&#10;        chosen.append(picked)&#10;        # 增量更新上界：只与刚选中的那条比&#10;        for i, c in enumerate(rest):&#10;            s = sim_lookup(c, picked)     # 查表；缺失返回 tag 相等则 1.0 否则 0.0&#10;            if s &gt; max_sim[i]:&#10;                max_sim[i] = s&#10;        max_sim.pop(best_i)&#10;    return chosen\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># MMR 贪心选 8 条；sim 为查表得到的相似度（缺失时用标签级近似）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> select_mmr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cands, k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lam</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # cands: [{\"cand\": str, \"rel\": float, \"src\": str, \"dir\": str, \"tag\": str}]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    chosen, rest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cands)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    max_sim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rest)          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每条候选与已选集的最大相似度上界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(chosen) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rest:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        best_i, best_v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1e9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rest):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            mmr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lam </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lam) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_sim[i]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mmr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_v:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                best_i, best_v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, mmr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        picked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rest.pop(best_i)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        chosen.append(picked)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 增量更新上界：只与刚选中的那条比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rest):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sim_lookup(c, picked)     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查表；缺失返回 tag 相等则 1.0 否则 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_sim[i]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                max_sim[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        max_sim.pop(best_i)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chosen</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个实现的复杂度是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k \\cdot n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 次查表，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 时约 1600 次，在结果页关键路径上完全可以接受。注意 <code>sim_lookup</code> 的降级路径写在函数内部——<strong>相似度缺失不是一个错误状态，而是一个正常分支</strong>，这一点决定了代码不需要为长尾查询写两套逻辑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"的取值\">λ 的取值</h3><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越偏相关，越小越偏多样。相关搜索的经验区间大约在 0.6 到 0.8。取值不能是常数，而应当随<strong>查询的宽窄</strong>变化：宽泛查询（<code>耳机</code>）需要多样性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 取低值），因为用户自己也没想清楚要什么；精确查询（<code>sony wh-1000xm5 case</code>）需要相关（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 取高值），因为用户已经知道要什么，给他别的方向是打扰。查询宽窄可以用结果数、查询长度、以及类目预测的熵作为代理指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"列表级硬约束\">列表级硬约束</h2><p>MMR 输出之后还要过一层<strong>规则校验</strong>，因为贪心算法不保证满足硬性约束。这些约束在生产里比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 调参更重要，因为它们防的是「看起来很正常的坏列表」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>硬约束</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>违反时的动作</th>\n<th>防的是什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来源份额上限</td>\n<td>单来源（如 <code>refine_drilldown</code>）占比 ≤ 3/8</td>\n<td>剔除超出部分，用次优候选补位</td>\n<td>列表退化成单一来源的输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方向覆盖</td>\n<td>至少 1 条 <code>broaden</code> 或 <code>sibling</code></td>\n<td>强行插入分数最高的非 refine 候选</td>\n<td>用户想换方向时被锁住</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀重复</td>\n<td>任两条候选共享 ≥ 3 个连续 token</td>\n<td>保留高相关的一条</td>\n<td><code>x</code>、<code>x x</code>、<code>x xx</code> 这类冗余</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>禁用词</td>\n<td>命中禁用/风控词表</td>\n<td>直接剔除，不补位</td>\n<td>见第三章第 3 篇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果数下限</td>\n<td>候选执行后结果数 &lt; 5</td>\n<td>剔除</td>\n<td>点进去是空页面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>来源份额上限</strong>对应的是第一章第 2 篇提出的担心：分面细化在用户真正想换方向时会帮倒忙，所以它的份额必须在排序层被硬性限制，而不能指望 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 自动平衡。</p>\n<p><strong>方向覆盖</strong>是一条容易被忽略但效果显著的约束。共现图给出的候选里 <code>refine</code> 方向天然占多数（因为细化行为在日志里最常见），如果不强制覆盖，列表会几乎全是细化词。强制插入一条 <code>broaden</code> 或 <code>sibling</code> 候选，可以在不损失精度的情况下显著改善长会话中的用户体验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与个性化层的关系\">与个性化层的关系</h2><p>这一篇算出的 8 条是<strong>与用户无关的内容分</strong>。第二章第 2 篇会在它之上叠加个性化与上下文权重，第 3 篇会叠加商业目标权重。三层的顺序不能颠倒：<strong>先保证列表本身是好的，再让它适配个人，最后才谈商业引导</strong>。反过来做（先按商业价值挑，再调多样性）会得到一个「每条都能赚钱但整体很难用」的列表，而这种情况在多目标混排系统里非常常见，见 <a href=\"commercial-demand-balance\">引导价值与用户需求平衡</a>。</p>\n<p>一个接口上的纪律：本篇输出的 8 条必须带上<strong>完整的三组特征值与 MMR 分</strong>，而不是只给排好序的字符串。第 2、3 篇需要在这个基础上重新加权，如果只传结果不传特征，它们就只能做「加插播」而无法做「重排序」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>相关搜索排序是<strong>列表级</strong>问题：候选之间不独立，8 条同质候选的整体价值接近 1 条。</li>\n<li>MMR 的贪心形式是可在线落地的标准做法，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k \\cdot n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 时在微秒级。</li>\n<li>相关性分由三组特征合成：行为统计（防「碰巧共现」）、语义（补长尾）、质量（拦「相关但无用」）；<strong>方向必须作为独立特征</strong>，不能让模型从相似度里推断。</li>\n<li>候选相似度矩阵离线预计算，长尾查询降级到标签级近似——<strong>降级是正常分支，不是错误状态</strong>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 随查询宽窄自适应（宽查询偏低、精确查询偏高），经验区间 0.6–0.8。</li>\n<li>列表级硬约束（来源份额、方向覆盖、前缀重复、结果数下限）比调参更重要，必须显式校验。</li>\n<li>内容分先行，个性化与商业权重叠加在后；输出必须携带完整特征值供后两层重排。见 <a href=\"personalized-context-rank\">个性化与上下文加权</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"相关性与多样性排序","id":"相关性与多样性排序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：列表级目标而非条目级目标","id":"核心概念-列表级目标而非条目级目标"},{"level":2,"text":"相关性分怎么来","id":"相关性分怎么来"},{"level":3,"text":"行为统计特征","id":"行为统计特征"},{"level":3,"text":"语义特征","id":"语义特征"},{"level":3,"text":"质量特征","id":"质量特征"},{"level":2,"text":"候选相似度矩阵","id":"候选相似度矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"离线预计算与近似","id":"离线预计算与近似"},{"level":3,"text":"用一个便宜的结构替代全矩阵","id":"用一个便宜的结构替代全矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"λ 的取值","id":"的取值"},{"level":2,"text":"列表级硬约束","id":"列表级硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"与个性化层的关系","id":"与个性化层的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨语言/多语言相关 query 生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/related-search-query-recommendation/related-query-candidates/multilingual-related-gen"},"next":{"title":"个性化与上下文加权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/related-search-query-recommendation/related-query-ranking/personalized-context-rank"}}